{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-truth-phone-onboarding-db-b-01","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"gap-9","surface":"phone","area":"phone/onboarding-db","refs":["F-phone-1609","F-phone-1613","F-phone-1619"],"severity":"S3","title":"A workout the member logs through the coach on the day the demo was loaded, or earlier, is treated as the demo's and deleted with it","what":"The app tells the demo's workouts apart from the member's by date: coach-logged workouts dated on or before the demo's last day count as the demo's. The demo's last day is the day it was loaded, not the day before. So a workout the member logs through the coach chat that same day, or for an earlier date, is left out of 'your own workouts stay', left out of the Replace import count, and is deleted when the demo is removed. The coach chat is hidden today, so only testers can hit this.","expected":"Only the demo's own rows count as the demo's; anything the member logs after loading the demo stays and is counted, whatever date it carries.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/onboarding/db/dataActions.ts:195-203","apps/mobile/src/onboarding/db/dataActions.ts:420","apps/mobile/src/onboarding/db/dataActions.ts:223-246","apps/mobile/src/ai/tools.ts:198-205","apps/mobile/src/onboarding/db/importSafety.ts:218-227"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"demo-cutoff-day-includes-load-day","who":"members trying the demo with the coach on","how_often":"whenever the coach logs a workout on the demo's load day or a past date","fix_line":"Mark the demo's own rows when they are made, instead of guessing by date","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
